Run `pnpm install` from the project root to install all dependencies across the monorepo. Then generate the Prisma client with `pnpm --filter @kit/database prisma:generate`. The monorepo uses PNPM Catalogs for consistent dependency versions across packages.

This guide is part of the [Next.js Prisma SaaS Kit installation](./overview).

